```text
(U-TAC)   For every N >= 3, in Q[u, B, w_2, l_2, ..., l_N] with b = 1 and
          u = 4 eta + 3 l_2 :        u  in  rad( Phi_{2N+1}, ..., Phi_{4N} ).
