+**10. Reproduction, limitations, and final audit.**
+
+The substantive new drivers are `finite_geometry.py` (all degree strata and coefficient images), `check_closing.py` (compact closing-ideal replay), `structure_checks.py` (exact identities, maps and square-root slice), and `theory_low_degree.py` (independent exact low-degree reconstruction). Compact field, pivot, basis and membership results are in their corresponding JSON and output files. No large standard basis is dumped. `finite_summary.json` records the finite-field factor checks and exact finite classifications; the final lane summary records the claim scope separately from the computation status.
