+Their exact resultant is `7323721655258186443534573944585584640000`, nonzero. These low-degree checks were also independently reconstructed in `theory_low_degree.py`.
+
+Undoing the leading-coefficient normalization now exhausts every actual degree permitted at N=4 or N=5. Every solution lies on C_B or C_3; both families are solutions. Since J_N is radical, geometric equality and faithful extension to the algebraic closure give
