+**8. The exact unresolved algebraic statement.**
+
+The finite-degree reduction in §4 applies in every actual degree m >= 2 in characteristic zero. For each factor of `Q[d]/(3d²-m)`, let K_m and the reconstructed coefficient `eta_m=P2` be defined by that scalar-pivot algorithm. These definitions use only (UF), not chart certificates or ray constants.
